      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hitler was a real person, who did horrible things, and convinced his people to do horrible things, and continues to inspire people to do horrible things.\nThat said, this world is someones creation, they aren't breaking any VRchat TOS by having an image of hitler. Just because something offends you doesn't mean it has to be canceled or erased.\nYou don't have to like humanities history, but if we ignore it and destroy it, and don't learn from it, we are doomed to repeat it.\nAlso, this portion of VRchat's website is not meant for reporting worlds that offend you. It's for reporting bugs in VRchat's software, and for making suggestions for future features, and give feed back on current features.",
